{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】10月22日now早晨新聞重點</p>\n<p>【獨立委員會報告】據了解，宏福苑火災獨立委員會今日會向特首提交報告。據悉當中不會提及問責官員，但就點名4個政府部門失職。</p>\n<p>【天星小輪加價】天星小輪中環及灣仔來往尖沙咀航線將加價，每程最多加1.8元。</p>\n<p>【中俄戰略溝通】李強與普京在聖彼得堡會面，討論加強中俄戰略溝通。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T23:40:37.614209+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T23:22:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T23:37:47.849438+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T23:37:47.849438+00:00","content_hash":"77ff9dda2ba835da39d8e3594f030f73367d25d9eedd09cd85a2bef14acee34d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}